><td>6 (9.3)</td><td>0.15 (0.02–1.29)</td><td>.047</td></tr><tr><td> Stroke</td><td>4 (4.1)</td><td>4 (6.4)</td><td>0.91 (0.23–3.65)</td><td>.89</td></tr><tr><td> Cardiovascular death</td><td>10 (11.6)</td><td>17 (19.5)</td><td>0.54 (0.25–1.18)</td><td>.11</td></tr><tr><td> Serious adverse events</td><td>20 (26.4)</td><td>35 (49.4)</td><td>0.50 (0.29–0.88)</td><td>.013</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class="table-overflow"><table role="table" aria-labelledby="
